        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BST03002R, Decorative Round Reed Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large 2-3/4\" round rosette can be added to door pulls to make them even more dramatic and decorative. They are supplied standard with <a href=\"/products/castle-door-pull-first-impressions-cst1rddrr\"><b>Decorative Reed Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/traditional-rope-style-door-pull-fii-833p-30-us15\"><b>Decorative Rope Door Pull</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in many different finishes to compliment and match your door pulls. The highly detailed design is impeccably crafted from solid forged brass. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions BST03002R Boston Reed Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Hole Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA door pull typically has at least two mounting points, so you need to order a rosette for each mount point.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
